    "title" : "6 Target Rd, Auckland - Niseko Real Estate Photographer",
    "sourceUrl" : "",
    "body" : "<div class=\"sqs-layout sqs-grid-12 columns-12\" data-layout-label=\"Post Body\" data-type=\"item\" data-updated-on=\"1730454859592\" id=\"item-6724949070ef64067c086d74\"><div class=\"row sqs-row\"><div class=\"col sqs-col-12 span-12\"><div class=\"sqs-block html-block sqs-block-html\" data-block-type=\"2\" data-sqsp-block=\"text\" id=\"block-bc079122e203acc469d9\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n<div class=\"sqs-html-content\" data-sqsp-text-block-content>\n  <p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>About us:</strong> PropertyMedia Japan specializes in Real Estate Photography, Videography, Aerial Photography, Floorplans and Virtual Staging. Previously based in Queenstown New Zealand, we are now operating in Niseko, Hokkaido Japan. </p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bedrooms:</strong> Four well-lit, spacious bedrooms provide restful spaces, each thoughtfully designed to offer comfort and privacy for every member of the family.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Bathroom:</strong> A stylish, modern bathroom equipped with quality fixtures adds a touch of luxury to your daily routine.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Living Areas:</strong> With two separate living rooms, there\u2019s ample space for relaxation, family gatherings, or entertaining guests. Large windows flood these areas with natural light, creating a warm and inviting atmosphere.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Kitchen:</strong> The kitchen is a functional blend of style and efficiency, featuring contemporary appliances, ample storage, and a layout that makes cooking a joy.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Garage:</strong> A single-car garage offers secure parking and additional storage, making it a convenient feature of this well-designed property.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\"><strong>Outdoor Space:</strong> The property includes a landscaped outdoor area, perfect for unwinding in the fresh air or hosting outdoor gatherings.</p><p class=\"\" style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\">Built with quality and care, this home at 6 Target Rd offers a serene lifestyle with the convenience of nearby amenities. Its spacious layout, thoughtful details, and tranquil surroundings make it a fantastic choice for anyone seeking a comfortable home in New Zealand.</p>\n</div>\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n  \n  \n\n\n\n</div></div><div class=\"sqs-block gallery-block sqs-block-gallery\" data-block-json=\"&#123;&quot;existingGallery&quot;:null,&quot;hSize&quot;:null,&quot;newWindow&quot;:false,&quot;floatDir&quot;:null,&quot;methodOption&quot;:&quot;transient&quot;,&quot;aspectRatio&quot;:null,&quot;auto-crop&quot;:true,&quot;blockAnimation&quot;:&quot;none&quot;,&quot;collectionId&quot;:&quot;6724a2a2a412982515599c2f&quot;,&quot;design&quot;:&quot;stacked&quot;,&quot;show-meta&quot;:true,&quot;show-meta-basic&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-title&quot;:false,&quot;show-meta-only-description&quot;:false,&quot;square-thumbs&quot;:true,&quot;vSize&quot;:null,&quot;transientGalleryId&quot;:&quot;6724a2a2a412982515599c2f&quot;&#125;\" data-block-type=\"8\" data-sqsp-block=\"gallery\" id=\"block-yui_3_17_2_1_1730450057056_55550\"><div class=\"sqs-block-content\">\n\n\n  \n\n  \n\n\n<div class=\"\n  sqs-gallery-container\n  sqs-gallery-block-stacked\n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n    \n    \n  \n  \n  \n  \n\n  \n  \n\n  \n  block-animation-none\n  clear\"\n  \n  \n>\n  <div class=\"sqs-gallery\">\n    \n      \n        \n          <div class=\"image-wrapper\" id=\"6724a2c12e20f71f1e2b4f3c\" data-type=\"image\" data-animation-role=\"image\">\n            \n              <noscript><img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/v1/66c59c726b45c63a433f4c32/1730454218195-IZW0C2BOTUISY23OZ91B/6+Target+Rd%2C+Auckland+-++Niseko+Kutchan+Hokkaido+Jap